# PE-9954: local override for the AppArmor unix-chkpwd profile.
# Ubuntu 24.04: adds the upstream dac_read_search (commit 556396a1, not backported);
#   without it containerized PAM/sudo cannot read a 0000 /etc/shadow (snapd pulls
#   apparmor into every Ubuntu image for systemd-sysext support).
# SLEM/openSUSE: applied only if their profile includes local/unix-chkpwd; SUSE
#   tracks this fix as bsc#1241678, so this is at worst a duplicate rule.
# RHEL/Hadron: no AppArmor; the file is inert.
# Read-only grant; dac_override is not needed and would also allow write bypass.
capability dac_read_search,
